description:
Tired of building customer journeys manually in Zoho? Use a Deluge function and invokeurl API inside CRM workflow rules for instant, automated customer onboarding.

1. Create a custom function in CRM
2. Use 'invokeurl' to hit the Marketing Automation trigger API
3. Associate the function with a Workflow Rule

Code (deluge) - Settings › Developer Space › Functions › Create New Function:
contactEmail = input.get("email");
url = "https://marketingautomation.zoho.com/api/v1/json/addcontact";
params = map();
params.put("resfmt", "JSON");
params.put("portalname", "YOUR_PORTAL_NAME");
params.put("listkey", "YOUR_LIST_KEY");
params.put("email", contactEmail);
response = invokeurl
(
	url:url
	type:POST
	parameters:params
	connection:"your_oauth_connection"
);
info response;

